  "description": "Haneul Yeon is a famous TV producer and the first to enter a same-sex marriage after it was legalized in Korea. But... he divorces two years later and has a drunken one-night stand with his childhood friend, leaving him conflicted. Six years later, Haneul takes over a show starring Yul Won, a recently divorced rising chef—also a childhood friend. When they meet again, Yul drops a major confession, but Haneul has “no taste for younger men.” Will he accept Yul's feelings or push him away? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
